  "job_B3.2.3_20251003_114631": {
    "text": "Men \u00f0a leofestan, mana\u00f0 us & myndga\u00f0 on \u00feyssum bocum sanctus Gregorius, se halega writere se \u00f0is\nL\u00e6re\u00f0 he us \u00fe\u00e6t we sien gemyndige \u00feara worda \u00fee dryhten s\u00e6de on his bocum, \u00f0\u00e6t \u00feis woruldlice lif\n& he us eac s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t swylc yfel on \u00feysne middangeard becuman sceolde, \u00e6r he geendod w\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t he\nMen \u00f0a leofestan, ne l\u00e6ten we us n\u00e6fre \u00fea synne to \u00feon swi\u00f0e micele ne to \u00fean swi\u00f0e hefiglice \u00feyncan\nHe \u00f0onne, se \u00e6\u00f0ela lareow, sanctus Paulus se apostol, spr\u00e6c & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Men \u00fea leofestan, us\n& \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6r n\u00e6nig man his sylfes gewyrhta behydan ne m\u00e6g, ne nan man his agenne andwlitan on\nBe \u00f0am se \u00e6lmihtega God s\u00e6de & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Filius hominis uenturus est in gloria cum angelis suis;\nUton we nu georne \u00feencean, men \u00fea leofestan, hu arf\u00e6st & hu mildheort he eft cyme\u00f0 on \u00feam dome to\nUton we nu ge\u00feencan hwylce we nu syn & hu us \u00feonne lyste\u00f0.\nHw\u00e6t, we si\u00f0\u00f0an ne magon nane lade gedon, ac we sculon gehwylcra \u00feinga Gode riht ongyldan on\n& we us urne dryhten ondr\u00e6dan \u00fe\u00e6nne we hyne mid his m\u00e6gen\u00ferymme cumendne gesio\u00f0, in \u00f0am\n& hie \u00feonne, \u00fea englas, him beforan singan onginna\u00fe & cwe\u00f0a\u00f0: Arisa\u00fe nu ealle \u00fea forsciridan &\n& hie \u00feonne cuma\u00f0, \u00fea englas, to \u00feam feower endum \u00feysses middangeardes & hyra byman blawa\u00f0.\n\u00deonne arisa\u00f0 ealle \u00fea \u00fee fram frym\u00fee middangeardes hira eagan in dea\u00f0 betyndon & rihtum geleafan\n& \u00fea \u00fee her nella\u00f0 hyra synna andettan & betan, Iudeas \u00feonne & sylfcwalan & h\u00e6\u00f0ene men, ne \u00f0urfon\n\u00de\u00e6nne bio\u00f0 ealle ior\u00f0an m\u00e6gen onstyrede in fyres gecynde.\n\u00deonne \u00fea scyldegan him hearde ondr\u00e6da\u00f0, & hie \u00feonne se \u00e6lmigtiga God onginne\u00f0 \u00fereagean mid his\n\u00d0a \u00f0u forhogodest mine bebodu & me sylfne, & \u00feone awyrgedan dioful \u00feu lufudest.\n& \u00fea \u00f0u w\u00e6re of neorxnawange ascofen & ic \u00fee wolde eft miltsian, \u00fea ic f\u00e6mnelicne inno\u00f0 gesohte, &\n& ic dranc eced wi\u00f0 eallan gemenged, for \u00fean \u00fee ic \u00fee dyde minre swetnesse wyr\u00f0ne.\n& eac swylce \u00feyrnenne beag ic onfeng ofer min heafod for \u00f0e, & ic w\u00e6s wundum \u00feyrel, to \u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u\n& ic \u00feis eal fremede for \u00f0e.\nHw\u00e6t gedydest \u00f0u for me?\nLoca nu & sceawa \u00fea dolg on minum handum & on minum fotum, & gesioh \u00f0as mine sidan \u00fee w\u00e6s\n\u00deynum sare \u00fee ic on minum lichoman onfeng, to \u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t ic wolde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u w\u00e6re rixiende in heofona\nFor hwan, la man, forlur \u00f0u \u00feis eal, \u00fee ic for \u00fee \u00ferowode?\nFor hwan w\u00e6r \u00f0u swa un\u00feancul \u00feinre onlysnesse?\nIc nawuht ma to minum dea\u00fee ne bidde.\nAgif me \u00feine sawle swa cl\u00e6ne swa ic hy \u00f0e sealde.\nMin feorh ic sealde for \u00f0e.\nAgif me \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fein lif \u00f0e \u00f0u acwealdest mid sarlycum wundum \u00feinra synna.\nFor hwan forwyrndest \u00f0u me \u00fe\u00e6s mines agenan yrfes?\nIc w\u00e6s \u00fein f\u00e6der & \u00fein dryhten & emne eallinga \u00fein freond geworden, and \u00f0u hit \u00fea sealdest \u00feinum\nAc hw\u00e6t druge \u00f0u on \u00feam, \u00fea ic w\u00e6s unawendedlic in minre godcundnesse, & \u00fea ic w\u00e6s in\u00ferowendlic,\n& \u00feu me mid ealle forhogodest.\n& ic \u00fee la\u00f0ode to minum \u00feam \u00ebcan life to \u00f0am uplycan rice, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u agymeleasodost.\nGa\u00f0 ge nu, awyrgedan, in \u00fe\u00e6t ece fyr & in \u00fea ecean forwyrd \u00fee gefyrn \u00e6rest w\u00e6s \u00f0am diofle Satane &\n\u00de\u00e6r ne bi\u00f0 n\u00e6fre \u00e6nig lioht gesewen ne n\u00e6nig wynsumnes gemeted, ac \u00fe\u00e6r syndon \u00fea wyrrestan\n& \u00fe\u00e6r syndon \u00fea undea\u00f0lican wyrmas \u00fee n\u00e6fre ne swelta\u00f0, & \u00fe\u00e6t fyr ne bi\u00f0 n\u00e6fre adw\u00e6sced, ac hit to\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6r is eagena wop & to\u00f0a gristbitung, and \u00fe\u00e6r syndon \u00fea unm\u00e6tan \u00feystro, & \u00fe\u00e6r is egesa &\nAc \u00f0\u00e6r is sio wyrreste adl & se bitera wop & a in ecnesse celnes.\nMen \u00fea leofestan, uton we us giorne biorgan, & utan giorne biddan \u00fe\u00e6t we moton \u00fe\u00e6s wyr\u00f0e bion \u00fee\n\u00de\u00e6r is symle ece blis & so\u00f0 syb & gefea, & \u00fe\u00e6r is singalic Godes lof gehyred, & \u00fe\u00e6r is lufu &\nMen \u00fea liofestan, gif we nu willa\u00f0 on \u00feysse worulde teala don, \u00fea \u00ferage \u00fee us wile se \u00e6lmihtiga",
